{"id": "1505", "title": "惊鸿星经", "author": "余者", "category": "武侠修真", "count": 142, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/1/1505.htm", "intro": "此法非意念强横微细者不可修，非肉体强横者不可修，非修为浅薄者不可修。\r\n　　孤鸿子，生于清末，为太冲观独龙道长收养之遗孤，自幼便随独龙道长行医天下，阅尽道藏书卷。由是博闻强记，他得了个过目不忘之能。孤鸿子由此推而广之，将这过目不忘之能从道藏书卷延至万事万物，达到眼中所见、心中所思，尽为心中所得。长年累月之下，孤鸿子便越觉头脑清醒，几十年后，又达到意识外放、闭目便能知万事万物之境。他从此便走上修道之路。", "base": "files/article/html/1/1505", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "实力划分参照", "file": "1736162.html", "available": false}, {"title": "引子 接引星光", "file": "1736163.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1 撞上了星球", "file": "1736164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2 天穹派惊穹", "file": "1736165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3 洞天福地（1）", "file": "1736166.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4 洞天福地（2）", "file": "1736168.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5 洞天福地（3）", "file": "1736169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6 洞天福地（4）", "file": "1736171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7 渡劫", "file": "1736172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8 飞升", "file": "1736174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9 命悬一线", "file": "1736176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10 实力大增", "file": "1736177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11 天穹城", "file": "1736178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12 青火道人", "file": "1736179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13 天穹塔", "file": "1736180.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14 道童（1）", "file": "1736181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15 道童（2）", "file": "1736182.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16 交代（1）", "file": "1736183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18 十年", "file": "1736184.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19 成奎", "file": "1736185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20 奇葩星（1）", "file": "1736186.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21 奇葩星（2）", "file": "1736188.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22 奇葩星（3）", "file": "1736189.html", "available": false}, {"title"